{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32198","headline":"秘书刘尚书挽歌词二首 一 · 温庭筠","name":"秘书刘尚书挽歌词二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"王笔活鸾凤，谢诗生芙蓉。\n学筵开绦帐，谈柄发洪钟。\n粉署见飞鵩，玉山猜卧龙。\n遗风丽清韵，萧散九原松。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32198.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32198","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}